[{"id":5529109779,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSY-FEw","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Unfortunately, this will break existing shaders if there is no space proceeding the continuation. See the following examples:\n\n#### Macro name absorbs the next line (get_identifier)\n\n```gdshader\nshader_type spatial;\n\n#define SCALE\\\n    0.5\n\nvoid fragment() {\n        ALBEDO = vec3(SCALE);\n}\n```\n\n- Master: SCALE expands to 0.5.\n- Patch: the macro name reads as SCALE0.5, which is not a valid identifier. Error:\n\n```\nError at line 3: Invalid macro name.\n```\n\n#### Macro switches from object-like to function-like (process_define checks peek() == '(')\n\n```gdshader\nshader_type spatial;\n\n#define HALF\\\n    (0.5)\n\nvoid fragment() {\n        ALBEDO = vec3(HALF);\n}\n```\n\n- Master: HALF is an object-like macro with body (0.5).\n- Patch: the ( now directly follows the name, so it is parsed as a parameter list. Error:\n\n```\nError at line 3: Invalid argument name.\n```\n\n#### Two body tokens merge (advance)\n\n```gdshader\nshader_type spatial;\n\n#define DECL float\\\n    v = 0.5;\n\nvoid fragment() {\n        DECL\n        ALBEDO = vec3(v);\n}\n```\n\n- Master: the body is float    v = 0.5;.\n- Patch: the body becomes floatv = 0.5;. Error: \n\n```\nError at line 7: Unknown identifier in expression: 'floatv'.\n```","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112490#pullrequestreview-5529109779","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112490","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112490#pullrequestreview-5529109779"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112490"}},"submitted_at":"2026-10-15T06:35:32Z","commit_id":"de36c7a93e1035def0cc35ea25f744bf749ed8a5"},{"id":5565065602,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABS7Qpgg","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Thanks! Changes look good to me.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112490#pullrequestreview-5565